      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "The town's ageing population was increasing demand for accessible services. Meanwhile, families needed affordable childcare and safe places to meet. The number of requests was rising, but the amount of funding was limited. Neither proposal could be judged fairly without information about who would use it and how often.",
        "zh": "小镇人口老龄化，使方便老年人使用的服务需求增加。同时，家庭需要可负担的托育和安全聚会场所。申请数量上升，但资金有限。若不了解使用者是谁、使用频率如何，就无法公平评价任何一项提议。",
