      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "Maya suggested a shared community building. It could host activities for children in the afternoon and social sessions for older people in the morning. This might reduce loneliness and encourage inclusion, although the committee would still need to examine transport, staffing and access. A building alone could not guarantee participation.",
        "zh": "玛雅建议共用一栋社区建筑。下午可举办儿童活动，上午可安排老年社交活动。这或许能减轻孤独、促进包容，但委员会仍需考察交通、人员配备和出入条件。一栋建筑本身不能保证人们参与。",
