        "index": 4,
        "text": "The final budget reserved money for a small pilot and an independent evaluation. The committee published its priorities and explained the opportunity cost: funding one project meant delaying another. Maya supported the decision because it included a review. She hoped that transparent planning would help residents discuss public spending with greater trust.",
